Hi Patrick-
We currently do not include this functionality (interaction of mediation
effect with a pre-treatment covariate). It is at the top of our list,
thought. While not ideal, one can subset the data by the pre-treatment
variable that you think is moderating the mediation. But that is a short
term solution.

We'd love to hear examples/obtain data examples from you on this (beyond
those papers which we are aware of). Can you please let us know where you
go with this? When we adapt the program, it would be nice to benchmark this
against what others provide.

thanks,
Dustin

